{
  "an4.36:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.36 ",
  "an4.36:0.2": "4. Cakkavagga ",
  "an4.36:0.3": "Doṇasutta ",
  "an4.36:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā antarā ca ukkaṭṭhaṁ antarā ca setabyaṁ addhānamaggappaṭipanno hoti. ",
  "an4.36:1.2": "Doṇopi sudaṁ brāhmaṇo antarā ca ukkaṭṭhaṁ antarā ca setabyaṁ addhānamaggappaṭipanno hoti. ",
  "an4.36:1.3": "Addasā kho doṇo brāhmaṇo bhagavato pādesu cakkāni sahassārāni sanemikāni sanābhikāni sabbākāraparipūrāni; ",
  "an4.36:1.4": "disvānassa etadahosi: ",
  "an4.36:1.5": "“acchariyaṁ vata bho, abbhutaṁ vata bho. ",
  "an4.36:1.6": "Na vatimāni manussabhūtassa padāni bhavissantī”ti. ",
  "an4.36:1.7": "Atha kho bhagavā maggā okkamma aññatarasmiṁ rukkhamūle nisīdi pallaṅkaṁ ābhujitvā ujuṁ kāyaṁ paṇidhāya parimukhaṁ satiṁ upaṭṭhapetvā. ",
  "an4.36:1.8": "Atha kho doṇo brāhmaṇo bhagavato padāni anugacchanto addasa bhagavantaṁ aññatarasmiṁ rukkhamūle nisinnaṁ pāsādikaṁ pasādanīyaṁ santindriyaṁ santamānasaṁ uttamadamathasamathamanuppattaṁ dantaṁ guttaṁ saṁyatindriyaṁ nāgaṁ. ",
  "an4.36:1.9": "Disvāna yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an4.36:2.1": "“Devo no bhavaṁ bhavissatī”ti? ",
  "an4.36:2.2": "“Na kho ahaṁ, brāhmaṇa, devo bhavissāmī”ti. ",
  "an4.36:2.3": "“Gandhabbo no bhavaṁ bhavissatī”ti? ",
  "an4.36:2.4": "“Na kho ahaṁ, brāhmaṇa, gandhabbo bhavissāmī�